WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.100
An empty Melt workspace. Ask: Can this café survive?

00:03.100 --> 00:06.350
Melt builds charts and scenario tools from three files.

00:06.350 --> 00:09.000
Ask: What if beans cost 30% more? A cost control appears.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.200
Drag the control. Monthly profit drops to €2,416.

00:12.200 --> 00:16.000
Ask for break-even and a Monday control. Both appear in the workspace.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.300
Close on Mondays. Monthly profit rises to €2,836.

00:20.300 --> 00:24.000
Disconnect the agent. Run the saved tool locally.
